sentences.text:
State (NCT of Delhi) Vs. Ahmed Jaan reported in (2008) 14 SCC 582;
Hindustan Petroleum Corporation Ltd. and another Vs. Dolly Das reported in (1999) 4 SCC 450;
Commissioner of Central Excise Vs. M.P.V. Engg. Industries reported in (2003) 5 SCC 333; Vidya Devi Vs. State of Himachal Pradesh reported in (2020) 2 SCC 569;
Page No.# 7/13 Sukh Dutt Ratra and another Vs. State of Himachal Pradesh and others reported in (2022) 7 SCC 508; State of Maharastra Vs. Digambar reported in (1995) 4 SCC 683 and Tukaram Kanha Joshi Vs. MIDC reported in (2013) 1 SCC 353 to hold that the writ petition was devoid of any merit.

